 "lines": [
  {
   "say": "Every week, hundreds of people walk into your café.",
   "id": "171129_b74d6529-84c4-4b5a-b003-c47c94fbd1b5",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.25
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "And you don't know a single one.",
   "id": "171138_9ab6262a-a37a-4510-9961-987257ea8147",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.45
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Who's a regular? Who spends the most?",
   "id": "171129_2f529e9a-3ed9-4474-8dda-3f8e8afb758b",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.35
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "And when someone's unhappy, they don't tell you.",
   "id": "171128_eb5c6dd6-2dc0-49a9-9408-0ee0f46e71ed",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "They just leave. Then post one star.",
   "id": "171137_f90fb88a-35d4-4325-9d1a-ee13b747ac5d",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "So we're building something at Zavino Labs.",
   "id": "171139_c9114b05-6b20-4d08-b156-0d300271e4cd",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.35
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "A QR code on every table. An offer worth scanning.",
   "id": "171148_5b075b52-2ab3-4133-8cbf-b87ddbebd379",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.35
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Rafi scans, verifies, picks his order.",
   "id": "171128_42aa4792-f0b0-4cf9-bd12-fbc21fd4f105",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.6,
    "2": 0.9
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "One code. One bill. A real, paying customer.",
   "id": "171142_ce5e88a4-ac57-42f7-82a5-e470812d8a91",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.7,
    "2": 0.85
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "An hour later: how was it?",
   "id": "171149_39339dc9-0179-44bc-928f-b26fdd4990aa",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.5
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Loved it? Off to Google. Unhappy? You hear it first.",
   "id": "171142_5af83586-3414-4a34-baea-67dc0868337a",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.4
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Four visits later, Rafi's a regular.",
   "id": "171142_8f7ecb62-6feb-4a04-b9ea-5cdab7b5bea2",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.4
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Now she knows her regulars, her big spenders, who's gone quiet.",
   "id": "171148_c7436452-0fc4-4ffa-8a06-958f6dc9d404",
   "gaps": {
    "1": 0.3,
    "2": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "New burger? Eed? Pohela Boishakh? AI writes. You approve.",
